Imported sqlite3.c and sqlite3.h (installed in /sys/include).
SQLite is in the public domain; its notices remain in both files.
See https://www.sqlite.org/copyright.html and LICENSE.

Local changes:
- Native headers replace standard includes through SQLITE_CUSTOM_INCLUDE.
- LARGEST_INT64 uses an explicitly signed 64-bit constant: Plan 9's integer
  promotions otherwise make the original expression unsigned.
- The public header uses Plan 9 library/source pragmas and the caller's u.h.

plan9.[ch], mkfile, test/ and ../../cmd/sqlite3 are new generated9 code,
under the repository root LICENSE. No earlier Plan 9 port was imported.
